ots of lore\nHelpful community\n\nCons:\nSlow to start (took me 60 hours to get into the \"swing of things\"),\nPoor tutorial for new players\nRepetitve, grindy\nRequires you to create your own goals.", "timestamp_created": 1450216287, "timestamp_updated": 1480017413, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54314720630645752", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "19719041", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147805582", "personaname": "Jay$h", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jzbozo/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 105873, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1273, "playtime_at_review": 534, "last_played": 1789420171, "avatar": "b7fbf78e6d2abb73de19ff818cf221d1264cca7f"}, "language": "english", "review": "really cool game!", "timestamp_created": 1450213918, "timestamp_updated": 1450213918, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}